@Kyc.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295

### Register tenant + first admin (public, no JWT)
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/register-tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantName": "Acme Compliance",
  "tenantSlug": "acme",
  "adminEmail": "admin@acme.example",
  "adminPassword": "ChangeMe1"
}

### Login (public; returns short-lived JWT)
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantSlug": "acme",
  "email": "admin@acme.example",
  "password": "ChangeMe1"
}

### Health
GET {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### GraphQL smoke (Hot Chocolate)
POST {{Kyc.Api_HostAddress}}/graphql
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { apiStatus }"
}

###
